<title>USA: AMEX to list Canadian Occidental options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Canadian Occidental options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Monday it would trade options on shares of Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd traded in the U.S. beginning January 31.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20 and expirations in February, March, April and July. The stock was off 1/8 at 18-1/4 in U.S. trading Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>Position limits have been set at 7,500 contracts. Cohen, Duffy &amp; McGowen has been named the specialist unit. ((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
